‹Heading1,b:Changelog›
‹Rule:────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────›

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

The format is based on ‹Link,u:Keep a Changelog›, and this project adheres to ‹Link,u:Semantic Versioning›.

‹Link,b,u:Unreleased›

‹Heading3,b:Added›

  ‹Bullet:• ›‹Code: --drafts › flag to include draft pages in a build
  ‹Bullet:• ›Support for nested ‹Code: content/ › folders, for example ‹Code: content/blog/2026/ ›

‹Link,b,u:1.2.0›‹Heading2,b: - 2026-09-30›

‹Heading3,b:Added›

  ‹Bullet:• ›A ‹Code: watch › command that rebuilds on change
  ‹Bullet:• ›Syntax highlighting for fenced code in ‹Code: go ›, ‹Code: sh › and ‹Code: toml ›

‹Heading3,b:Changed›

  ‹Bullet:• ›Pages are now written in parallel; a build of 1,000 pages went from 2.1 s to 0.8 s
  ‹Bullet:• ›The default output folder is ‹Code: dist › instead of ‹Code: public ›

‹Heading3,b:Fixed›

  ‹Bullet:• ›Relative links in nested pages no longer point one folder too high (‹Link,u:#41›)
  ‹Bullet:• ›A crash on an empty front matter block
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›it also hit files with only a comment
    ‹Bullet:◦ ›both now build an empty page

‹Link,b,u:1.1.0›‹Heading2,b: - 2026-07-02›

‹Heading3,b:Added›

  ‹Bullet:• ›Table of contents for pages with more than three headings

‹Heading3,b:Deprecated›

  ‹Bullet:• ›The ‹Code: --public › flag, use ‹Code: --out › instead

‹Heading3,b:Removed›

  ‹Bullet:• ›The unmaintained ‹Code: legacy › theme

‹Link,b,u:1.0.0›‹Heading2,b: - 2026-05-15›

  ‹Bullet:• ›Initial release
